{
  "about": "A page is kept under the person its own answer was made for. Every native answer that may be kept names that person (`x-navree-person`); the core writes it only when it is the store's owner and the person this launch's shell named. A sign-in, a session's end and a sign-out clear who the shell named until a shell asked after them answers, and a shell request on its way at that moment is dropped and asked again. An answer naming someone other than the shell did is the news that the session changed: nothing of it is written, what is kept is emptied, and the shell is asked again.",
